# KPP parameters (Large et al. 1994; pkg/kpp). Every parameter keeps the MITgcm default
# (pkg/kpp/kpp_readparms.F), as approved in the PD0 section 6: Ricr = 0.3, Riinfty = 0.7,
# difm0 = difs0 = dift0 = 5e-3 m2 s-1, difmcon = difscon = diftcon = 0.1 m2 s-1,
# BVSQcon = -0.2e-4 s-2. Background viscosity and diffusivity: viscAr, diffKrT/S of data.
# Written only for cases with useKPP.
 &KPP_PARM01
